lass=\"down\">✗</span> Dimmer screen</li>\n          <li><span class=\"down\">✗</span> Small SSD</li>\n        </ul>\n      </div>\n    </div>\n    <div class=\"mt-md\">\n      <span class=\"muted small\">Best for:</span> Students and light office work\n    </div>\n    <button class=\"btn btn-secondary btn-block mt-md\">View Full Details</button>\n  </article>\n</section>\n\n<section class=\"stack gap-lg mb-lg\">\n  <h2>Performance & Price at a Glance</h2>\n  <div class=\"row gap-lg\">\n    <div data-chart='{\"type\":\"bar\",\"title\":\"Battery Life Comparison (hours)\",\"data\":[{\"label\":\"Aero 14\",\"value\":18},{\"label\":\"Forge 16\",\"value\":9},{\"label\":\"Nimbus 13\",\"value\":22}]}'></div>\n    <div data-chart='{\"type\":\"bar\",\"title\":\"Starting Price Comparison (USD)\",\"data\":[{\"label\":\"Aero 14\",\"value\":1299},{\"label\":\"Forge 16\",\"value\":1899},{\"label\":\"Nimbus 13\",\"value\":999}]}'></div>\n  </div>\n</section>\n\n<section class=\"stack gap-lg\">\n  <h2>Which Laptop is Right For You?</h2>\n  <div class=\"grid cols-3 gap-lg\">\n    <div class=\"card\">\n      <div class=\"card-title\">Aero 14</div>\n      <div class=\"card-desc\">Travel and everyday work</div>\n      <p class=\"mt-sm\">The best pick if you prioritize portability, battery life, and a stunning display for work on the go. Its quiet operation and gorgeous OLED screen make it ideal for frequent travelers and office workers.</p>\n      <div class=\"row gap-sm mt-sm\">\n        <span class=\"badge badge-secondary\">$1,299</span>\n        <span class=\"badge badge-outline\">18h battery</span>\n        <span class=\"badge badge-outline\">1.2kg</span>\n      </div>\n    </div>\n    <div class=\"card\">\n      <div class=\"card-title\">Forge 16</div>\n      <div class=\"card-desc\">Video editing, 3D and gaming</div>\n      <p class=\"mt-sm\">The top choice for power users who need desktop-class performance in a portable form. Its upgradeable components, full port selection, and high-refresh display handle intensive creative work and gaming with ease.</p>\n      <div class=\"row gap-sm mt-sm\">\n        <span class=\"badge badge-secondary\">$1,899</span>\n        <span class=\"badge badge-outline\">16-core CPU</span>\n        <span class=\"badge badge-outline\">32GB RAM</span>\n      </div>\n    </div>\n    <div class=\"card\">\n      <div class=\"card-title\">Nimbus 13</div>\n      <div class=\"card-desc\">Students and light office work</div>\n      <p class=\"mt-sm\">The most affordable, lightweight option for everyday tasks. With class-leading battery life and a low price point, it’s perfect for students, remote workers, and anyone who needs a reliable laptop for browsing, document editing, and streaming.</p>\n      <div class=\"row gap-sm mt-sm\">\n        <span class=\"badge badge-secondary\">$999</span>\n        <span class=\"badge badge-outline\">22h battery</span>\n        <span class=\"badge badge-outline\">1kg</span>\n      </div>\n    </div>\n  </div>\n</section>\n\n<style>\n  ul.pros-list, ul.cons-list, ul.ports-list {\n    list-style: none;\n    padding: 0;\n    margin: 0;\n  }\n  .gap-xs {\n    gap: 0.25rem;\n  }\n</style>\n\n<script>\n  document.getElementById('sortSelect').addEventListener('change', function(e) {\n    const grid = document.getElementById('laptopGrid');\n    const cards = Array.from(grid.querySelectorAll('.card'));\n    const sortValue = e.target.value;\n\n    cards.sort((a, b) => {\n      switch(sortValue) {\n        case 'price-asc':\n          return parseInt(a.dataset.price) - parseInt(b.dataset.price);\n        case 'price-desc':\n          return parseInt(b.dataset.price) - parseInt(a.dataset.price);\n        case 'rating-desc':\n          return parseFloat(b.dataset.rating) - parseFloat(a.dataset.rating);\n        case 'battery-desc':\n          return parseInt(b.dataset.battery) - parseInt(a.dataset.battery);\n        case 'weight-asc':\n          return parseFloat(a.dataset.weight) - parseFloat(b.data